    <briefdescription>
<para>An update transition that interpolates each kept item from its old values to its new ones. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Assign it to a series&apos; <computeroutput>updateTransition</computeroutput>. Items are matched by index. Non-finite values are never interpolated: an invalid target value is applied immediately, and a valid target value replaces an invalid source value without animation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DrawTransition" kindref="compound">DrawTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1GrowTransition" kindref="compound">GrowTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DataTransition" kindref="compound">DataTransition</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
